<title>Philippines: Occidental, Shell to supply gas to Philippine firm</title>
<headline>Occidental, Shell to supply gas to Philippine firm</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Occidental Philippines Inc and Shell Philippines Exploration B.V. will sign a memorandum of understanding to supply natural gas to the state-owned National Power Corp (Napocor), the U.S. Embassy in Manila said.</p>
<p>The two firms are units of of Occidental Petroleum Corp and Royal Dutch Shell and under the agreement to be signed on Monday they will supply gas to Napocor's Bataan Nuclear Power plant, the Embassy said in a statement on Monday.</p>
</text>
